# records of 41df0dd0d171b4bf
# If a callee in a copy were judged by its own operations, with the call that it writes counted as one of them, each function of a row would hold a copy of every function above it: N bodies of N levels
# what copies in copies add is counted at the call that the unit's own body writes, and together they get what one callee in a loop gets. Behind that the next function of the row is called
# RUN: walk f21 mechanisms=all
# CHECK: frame 1 callee=f20
# CHECK: frame 2 callee=f19
# CHECK: = CallDirect
# RUN(NEVER): walk f21 mechanisms=all
# NEVER-NOT: callee=f1 {{*}}
# RUN(ANSWERS): run-in-shell
# ANSWERS: the source prints the same

